  "key_sentences": [
    "September production fell short of plan because of lower head grade from the western wall of Stage 4 and a two-day mill shutdown.",
    "Unit costs rose to 2.41 dollars per pound of copper because fixed costs were spread over fewer tonnes.",
    "There were no lost-time injuries in September, and the site passed 112 days without one.",
    "The year-to-date lost-time injury frequency rate stands at 0.61 per million hours worked.",
    "On 14 September a haul truck reversed into a windrow at the Stage 4 dump after its rear camera failed.",
    "Total material movement was 1,714 kt, of which 396 kt was ore delivered to the run-of-mine pad.",
    "The mill treated 371 kt at an average rate of 571 t per operating hour.",
    "Following the bearing temperature alarm on ball mill 1 in August, the alarm thresholds were reviewed by the process control engineer.",
    "Fleet availability was 95.6% against a target of 92%, and utilisation was 80.0%.",
    "The next report will be issued on 8 November 2027."
  ],
